TI  - Multi-objective optimization of lignocellulolytic enzyme cocktail production from Pseudolagarobasidium acaciicola TDW-48 by artificial neural network-genetic algorithm (ANN-GA) strategy and its application in lignocellulose waste bioconversion
AU  - ['Luong
AU  - T.T.H.'
AU  - 'Poeaim
